# Agent context log habit

At the **end of every agent turn that changes code or makes decisions**, append a short dated entry to `doc/AGENT_CONTEXT_LOG.md`.

## Entry template

```markdown
### YYYY-MM-DD — <one-line title>

- **Goal:** …
- **Touched:** `path1`, `path2`
- **Decisions / skipped:** …
- **Follow-ups:** …
```

## Rules

- Append only; never rewrite prior entries.
- Prefer file paths over prose.
- If no code changed (Q&A only), skip the log.
- Keep CRS / process work aligned with `doc/ZEDRAL_CRS_OPERATOR_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` and ponytail when `/ponytail` is active.
